        "node_id": "n_17_b5b47a",
        "thought_text": "Identify the longest non-decreasing prefix of the string. Once the prefix ends at index k (where s[k] <= s[k+1] is false), the first inversion must occur at or after k. Specifically, finding the first i such that s[i] > s[i+1] is equivalent to finding the end of the longest non-decreasing prefix and checking the next pair.",
